# Admin data table pattern

Use the shared table system from Manage Users for any admin list/table page.

## Setup

1. Include styles once on the page:
   ```blade
   <x-admin.data-table-styles />
   ```

2. Wrap content in:
   ```blade
   <div class="main-content right-chat-active admin-data-table">
   ```

## Class reference (`adt-*`)

| Area | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Page header | `adt-page-header`, `adt-page-title`, `adt-page-subtitle`, `adt-btn-primary` |
| Stats row | `adt-stats`, `adt-stat`, `adt-stat-label`, `adt-stat-value` |
| Panel | `adt-panel`, `adt-toolbar`, `adt-filters`, `adt-search`, `adt-select` |
| Alerts | `adt-alert`, `adt-alert-success`, `adt-alert-error` |
| Table | `adt-table-wrap`, `adt-table`, `adt-th-sortable`, `adt-th-actions` |
| Cells | `adt-user-cell`, `adt-avatar`, `adt-user-name`, `adt-email`, `adt-tag`, `adt-muted` |
| Status | `adt-status`, `adt-status-dot`, `adt-status-active`, `adt-status-suspended` |
| Actions | `adt-actions`, `adt-action-btn`, `adt-action-danger` |
| Footer | `adt-footer`, `adt-footer-count`, `adt-pagination` |
| Empty | `adt-empty`, `adt-empty-icon`, `adt-empty-title`, `adt-empty-text` |

## Reference implementation

`resources/views/livewire/admin/manage-users.blade.php`

## Rules

- Neutral palette only; one primary accent (`#132977`).
- No `bg-current`, colored table headers, or badge-pill action buttons.
- Primary actions use `adt-btn-primary` (white text).
- Row actions use icon buttons in `adt-action-btn`.
- Pagination: `{{ $paginator->links('pagination::bootstrap-5') }}` inside `adt-pagination`.
